Subject: [PATCH] fix(a11y): keep pending writes and reviewer refresh fail
 closed

LT-117: persist the write claim, block overlapping actions, and retain invalid
conformance evidence on interrupted or uncertain writes pending reconciliation.
LT-109: refresh the mounted parent reviewer evidence after failed rescans too.
Add actual-route overlap and mounted-panel regressions from review findings.

Author-Model: GPT-6
